-- statement:
--   **The `A` axis step is the list pipeline** (round-six regime).
--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.J6AIL9`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem J6Seg.pipeA6_eq_r6 (P : Prm) (hP : P.Ok) : ∃ n₁ : ℕ, ∀ n, n₁ ≤ n → ∀ src : ℕ → ℕ,
--       SrcOK6 P n src → ∀ D : ℕ, dP6 P n = D + 1 → ∀ k ≤ D, ∀ L : List GI,
--       L.length = (List.ofFn (tD6 P n D)).prod →
--       pipeA6 P n src D k L = J6A.pipeAL (pP6 P n) (src k) (tF6 P n k) (αN6 P n) (HA6 P n)
--         (preT P n D k) (postT P n D k) L
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** A lines, IL side 9: the pipeline is the axis step `pipeA6`
--
--   **`pipeA6_eq`**: for an array of length `pre · (t_k · post_k)`, the `k`-th `A` axis step
--   `pipeA6 P n src D k` equals the list pipeline `J6A.pipeAL` (copies, gather slab pass,
--   regrouping, kernel pass, compress slab pass) at `p = pP6`, `s = s_k`, `t = t_k`, `α = αN6`,
--   `H = HA6` (`= J6A.PA.HH (pP6 P n) (αN6 P n)`), under the numeric side conditions of
--   `J6A.pipeAL_rep`.
